        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【温馨提示】道友好，如果您想购买本作，我们希望您先了解本作的大概玩法：</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本作是一款轻度化快节奏的修仙游戏，没有自由开放的修仙大世界，更多是在一次又一次轮回的选择中，寻觅更多的仙缘奇遇，做出正确的选择，不断增强自身实力，推进故事发展，主打轻度化和轻策略爽游。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本作主打轮回式多周目，并且游戏含有超过10个主线结局和双修结局、多个流派以及困难模式，整体游戏时长在6-10个小时以上，大家可以自由选择天赋、搭配技能和法宝，尝试不一样的流派、人生和结局。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >由于免费试玩版与正式版在数据以及系统上存在较大的差别，所以两个版本的存档并不互通，非常抱歉给您带来不好的体验。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >如果您无法确认游戏是否适合自己，欢迎下载我们的免费Demo试玩版，可以游玩1-2个小时，如适合您可以选择购入正式版，非常感谢！</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《轮回修仙传》是一款多结局的修仙人生模拟类游戏，玩家将扮演一位不断轮回试图打破天道约束的修炼者，通过一世又一世的轮回选择，发现更多的仙缘机遇，一直修炼突破境界，在命定之时战胜天道！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/ad522288fe598bd609473b6cd76a51be.avif?t=1784195563\" width=1200 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/0aa7159b5ef4122ab0e791ee1fe4f5f4.poster.avif?t=1784195563\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/0aa7159b5ef4122ab0e791ee1fe4f5f4.webm?t=1784195563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/0aa7159b5ef4122ab0e791ee1fe4f5f4.mp4?t=1784195563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在这个传统又带点梗的修仙背景下，你将从出生开始就要抉择你的人生道路，不同的选择或许会让你走上不一样的修仙人生，面对罕见的仙缘奇遇到底能否抓住机会？修炼、炼丹炼器和外出历练，规划好你的行动，在命定之战来临前做好准备！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/370a51e61a2f7d539754d1954980b032.avif?t=1784195563\" width=1200 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/f131ad26e162a2d8c862a99cc6a89954.poster.avif?t=1784195563\" width=1170 height=683 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/f131ad26e162a2d8c862a99cc6a89954.webm?t=1784195563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >高冷傲娇的灵剑宗亲传弟子-赵明月</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >精灵搞怪的青梅竹马白月光-林小叶</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >刁蛮任性的魔教逆天门圣女-苏琉璃</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >我们还设计了数名性格迥异的双修道侣，当你选择不同的路线时，她们可能是你修仙路上的得力助手，但也可能是与你拔剑相对的宿敌。游戏提供了超过10种可选路线，除了情缘结局以外还有分支结局。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/eefe524eae1c80b982945779554daf4f.avif?t=1784195563\" width=1200 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/f2c9e8f50e9cf418b9722c973c9777d9.poster.avif?t=1784195563\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/f2c9e8f50e9cf418b9722c973c9777d9.webm?t=1784195563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/f2c9e8f50e9cf418b9722c973c9777d9.mp4?t=1784195563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在修炼途中，我们提供了上百种五行属性的法术可以修习，你可以根据自己的成长方向，合理安排法术的上阵以及释放顺序，搭配各种仙丹和法器神通，以最强的姿态面对宿敌之战！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/0f2c69afab058c24aef804fa8a71584b.avif?t=1784195563\" width=1200 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/b9ab2a49dbd4336c2eee336d0fb75eae.poster.avif?t=1784195563\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/b9ab2a49dbd4336c2eee336d0fb75eae.webm?t=1784195563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/b9ab2a49dbd4336c2eee336d0fb75eae.mp4?t=1784195563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >修仙路上总是充满危险，你将会遭遇必然发生的宿命之战，战胜他们就可以继续走下去，如果不幸陨落则会重入轮回。所以在大战来临之前，一定要合理安排好你的时间，预留足够的丹药，管理好法术的释放顺序，踏着这些对手登仙成神！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/5bd39e1326a502277b216ec25218a148.avif?t=1784195563\" width=1200 height=132 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/38ab28624d8672aa7ec10329dd8911e9.poster.avif?t=1784195563\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/38ab28624d8672aa7ec10329dd8911e9.webm?t=1784195563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/38ab28624d8672aa7ec10329dd8911e9.mp4?t=1784195563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >道友，陨落不是终点！正如某位武道家所说“必可活用于下次······”，每次轮回都能使用轮回点提升自身初始属性，也能重置初始天赋和灵根，带着上一世的记忆选择正确的道路，开启你的修仙开挂人生，逆天改命！</p>",
