63\" width=1200 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/f131ad26e162a2d8c862a99cc6a89954.poster.avif?t=1784195563\" width=1170 height=683 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/f131ad26e162a2d8c862a99cc6a89954.webm?t=1784195563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >高冷傲娇的灵剑宗亲传弟子-赵明月</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >精灵搞怪的青梅竹马白月光-林小叶</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >刁蛮任性的魔教逆天门圣女-苏琉璃</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >我们还设计了数名性格迥异的双修道侣，当你选择不同的路线时，她们可能是你修仙路上的得力助手，但也可能是与你拔剑相对的宿敌。游戏提供了超过10种可选路线，除了情缘结局以外还有分支结局。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/eefe524eae1c80b982945779554daf4f.avif?t=1784195563\" width=1200 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/f2c9e8f50e9cf418b9722c973c9777d9.poster.avif?t=1784195563\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/f2c9e8f50e9cf418b9722c973c9777d9.webm?t=1784195563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/f2c9e8f50e9cf418b9722c973c9777d9.mp4?t=1784195563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在修炼途中，我们提供了上百种五行属性的法术可以修习，你可以根据自己的成长方向，合理安排法术的上阵以及释放顺序，搭配各种仙丹和法器神通，以最强的姿态面对宿敌之战！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458620/extras/0f2c69afab